{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques"]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/ClusteringCoefficients","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/CoreNumbers","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/GraphProtocols"],"generated":true}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"Cliques","modules":[{"name":"Cliques"}],"externalID":"Cliques","symbolKind":"module"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/GraphProtocols":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/GraphProtocols","role":"collection","title":"GraphProtocols","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/graphprotocols","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/ClusteringCoefficients":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/clusteringcoefficients","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ClusteringCoefficients","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ClusteringCoefficients","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ClusteringCoefficients","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/ClusteringCoefficients","abstract":[{"text":"Triangles and clustering for every vertex of an undirected graph’s simple graph, from one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/CoreNumbers":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CoreNumbers"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/CoreNumbers","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/corenumbers","abstract":[{"text":"The core decomposition of an undirected graph (Batagelj–Zaversnik), over its simple graph. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex’s core number is the largest k such that it lies in a subgraph where every vertex has at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"least k neighbors.","type":"text"}],"title":"CoreNumbers","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CoreNumbers"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","title":"MaximalCliques","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques","kind":"symbol","title":"Cliques","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","abstract":[]}}}